{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorhqc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorhqc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorhqc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorhqc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorhqc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorhqc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-09-09T09:45:51Z","updated_at":"2020-09-09T10:05:09Z","body":"Having the same issue, tried to workaround it by adding a `.cargo/config` file in the same path that the tauri application\r\n\r\n```toml\r\n[build]\r\ntarget-dir = \"src-tauri/target\"\r\n```\r\n\r\nBut couldn't make it work 😢 had to move all my code to its own repository for now.\r\n\r\n**Update**\r\n\r\nMade it work by using full path in `.cargo/config`\r\n\r\n1.  Do `pwd` to get full path\r\n\r\n1.  Modify `.cargo/config` and replace `<pwd>` with full path for repository targeting the correct `src-tauri` location.\r\n\r\n    ```toml\r\n    [build]\r\n    target-dir = \"<pwd>/src-tauri/target\"\r\n    ```","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tauri-apps/tauri/issues/comments/689453601/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"victorhqc","id":726113,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNjExMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/726113?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorhqc","html_url":"https://github.com/victorhqc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorhqc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorhqc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorhqc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorhqc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorhqc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorhqc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorhqc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorhqc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorhqc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tauri-apps/tauri/issues/comments/778738625","html_url":"https://github.com/tauri-apps/tauri/issues/1007#issuecomment-778738625","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tauri-apps/tauri/issues/1007","id":778738625,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDc3ODczODYyNQ==","user":{"login":"x7c1","id":994424,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NDQyNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/994424?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/x7c1","html_url":"https://github.com/x7c1","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/x7c1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/x7c1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/x7c1/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/x7c1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/x7c1/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/x7c1/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/x7c1/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/x7c1/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/x7c1/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-02-14T07:12:08Z","updated_at":"2021-02-14T07:12:08Z","body":"I've found similar workaround which doesn't need embedding the full path.\r\n\r\nInstead of modifying `.cargo/config`, you can add an [environment variable](https://doc.rust-lang.org/cargo/reference/config.html#buildtarget-dir) in `package.json` :\r\n\r\n```json\r\n  \"scripts\": {\r\n    \"tauri\": \"CARGO_BUILD_TARGET_DIR=$(pwd)/src-tauri/target tauri\",\r\n```\r\n\r\n`tauri build` will be able to find `src-tauri/target` as usual :+1: \r\n\r\n```\r\nnpm run tauri build\r\n```\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tauri-apps/tauri/issues/comments/778738625/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"x7c1","id":994424,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NDQyNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/994424?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/x7c1","html_url":"https://github.com/x7c1","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/x7c1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/x7c1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/x7c1/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/x7c1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/x7c1/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/x7c1/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/x7c1/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/x7c1/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/x7c1/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tauri-apps/tauri/issues/comments/778831753","html_url":"https://github.com/tauri-apps/tauri/issues/1007#issuecomment-778831753","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tauri-apps/tauri/issues/1007","id":778831753,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDc3ODgzMTc1Mw==","user":{"login":"lucasfernog","id":20051258,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMDUxMjU4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20051258?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucasfernog","html_url":"https://github.com/lucasfernog","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucasfernog/followers","following_url"